8. Termination

If you violate a condition of this license, the permissions it grants you
terminate automatically. Stop any activity that relies on those permissions.
For your first violation, those permissions are automatically reinstated
when you fully remedy the violation, provided you do so before receiving
written notice from Sergiu Lefter or within 30 days after receiving it.
The cure period does not authorize continued use while in violation.

For a subsequent violation, or if you miss the first violation's deadline,
you must fully remedy the violation and obtain written reinstatement from
Sergiu Lefter before resuming activities that require these permissions.
Termination does not affect earlier MIT grants, third-party licenses, other
independent rights, or contribution rights already granted to Sergiu Lefter.

